    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Play as a witch making their way through the perils of their forest home as they journey to the top of the <i>highest</i> tree for some much-needed groceries. Who knows what you'll find waiting for you...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/c9be1f1a93f7e52e986200c2e8104997.poster.avif?t=1700966576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/c9be1f1a93f7e52e986200c2e8104997.webm?t=1700966576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/c9be1f1a93f7e52e986200c2e8104997.mp4?t=1700966576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Played in third-person view, <strong>Witch Trials</strong> is an adventure platformer, allowing online lobbies up to 16 players as well as solo offline play. When you and your friends gather to traverse somewhere together, will you help each other up, or end up being a hindrance?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/3aedc6ae7ebdb63410517bd8f275268b.poster.avif?t=1700966576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/3aedc6ae7ebdb63410517bd8f275268b.webm?t=1700966576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/3aedc6ae7ebdb63410517bd8f275268b.mp4?t=1700966576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This game is relatively family friendly in nature, featuring cartoon violence but no heavy themes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/f6820edc6a3f1b202488ad960e019e98.poster.avif?t=1700966576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/f6820edc6a3f1b202488ad960e019e98.webm?t=1700966576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025490/extras/f6820edc6a3f1b202488ad960e019e98.mp4?t=1700966576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>",
